acme/limited: a rate limit on page 1 (exit 15, the reset time and the token sources, nothing written). acme/limited2: page 1 is fine and page 2 is limited: nothing is written, also not page 1 (R-DI13).
acme/gone, acme/slow: no answer (exit 15, the message names --offline). acme/offlinec: offline, 3 cached pages with the times 1792030000, 1792000000 and 1792050000 (the chain is the `next` line of each meta): no request, the oldest page time of the 3 (R-DI12: not the first, not the last, not the newest). acme/nothing: offline, no page: source missing.
hints: the raw URL (R-DI8, R-EV20) with no token even when the environment has one (R-DI9). A 404 is no hint. A 500 is exit 15.
Slice 068 (R-DI8): `hint!` keeps each answer in `talon/index/github/<owner>/<repo>/<tag>.roc-version` (the body of a 200, the empty text for a 404; a 500 is not kept). The runs 14 to 17 come after the first request of each tag: a tag that has a file makes one `read_files` and no request (run 14: the id of 2.1.0 comes back from the file, also when the run has no token; run 15, `offline`: the empty file of the 404 of 3.0.0 is `no hint`). Run 16 (4.0.0): the 500 of run 12 was not kept, so the file is missing and the request is made again (exit 15, nothing written). Run 17 (`offline`, 5.0.0): no file and no request: `no hint`, nothing written (R-DI12).
acme/nope (review Q2): a 404 of the release list is a usage failure (exit 2) that names the repository, nothing is written.
Slice 076 (R-SE18, R-ID3, R-DI1, R-EC2 bad ref): the runs 18 to 20 give an owner or a repo that is `..`: `releases ../acme`, `releases acme/..` and `releases ../..`. A part that is not a safe path part (`Ident.safe_part`) gives the usage failure of `Github.bad_repo` (exit 2) with no call at all: no `list_dirs`, no request, no write. The fake index has an answer (a page with 200) at the path that each unsafe name would reach (`fx/http/api.github.com/acme/releases`, `fx/http/api.github.com/repos/releases`, `fx/http/releases`), so a missing guard writes `1.json` and `1.meta` in `talon/index/`, in `talon/index/github/` and in `talon/` (the tree diff shows it).
